{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 86963, "game_id": 202, "entry_id": 60923, "uid": 63428, "type": 4, "title": "9-11月日历分析", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1630037577, "updated_at": 1631514579, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1631514579, "last_at": 0, "comment_count": 18, "status": 1, "summary": "第一件你需要知道的事：日服在上个月回归Shiftup韩国本部运营，至此三服已经统一运营，这一点在日历上就有体现：以前的日历会有角色立绘，而这期没有，就是因为本期国际服日历是三服同一个美工制作的，不信各", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1630038763419_54752481.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1630038759608_45090606.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1630038644918_53405051.jpg", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 17, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 16409, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 0, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 86963, "content": "<div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1630037936952_2426746.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1630037936952_2426746.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">第一件你需要知道的事：</span>日服在上个月回归Shift up韩国本部运营，至此三服已经统一运营，这一点在日历上就有体现：以前的日历会有角色立绘，而这期没有，就是因为本期国际服日历是三服同一个美工制作的，不信各位可以去查看韩服日历，一模一样的Q版该影和Q版火护士。并且昨天日服和国际服一起延长维护，同时开服，而韩服并没有延迟，这是因为服务器维护人员都被调去韩服了，韩服不敢延迟维护，因为发奖励太多。而日服国际服延长维护不痛不痒，于是比韩服晚了一个半小时开服。</span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">第二件事：</span>日、韩、国际服 三服在9.9的活动都是9.30结束，时长21天，三服统一时间。<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">虽然说应该是Shift up内部决策，或者统一放假也说不定？但不排除有两种特殊情况：</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">①<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">后续有三服同步活动</span>（不一定是联动，也有可能类似PlanetParty），<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">去年的21天木Raid后面就是DOA联动系列活动</span>，三服同时延长一周时间来给后面同步做铺垫。如果是联动应该会提前通知，各位不必太担心。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">②<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">回顾第一次21天Raid，是国际服唯一的9%爆率Raid</span>，碰上500天开服纪念日。这次出现9%的概率不大，可能性还不如①。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">第三件事：</span>中秋节限定活动地下城，暂时不知道是什么东西，是三服同步的活动，具体等韩服公告出来再看。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">第四件事：日服已经开放合成台，但是国际服推迟了，如果参考日服的话，有一种限时合成项目，4种素材各25个，直接合成点火石，不需要花费胎五。如图：</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">所以在合成台没开之前，各位尽量存好点火素材，不要乱合，万一出这个活动，你身上没素材，没法参加，就很难受了。（当然一切都是猜想，具体还要看国际服策划怎么想的。）</span><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1630038644918_53405051.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1630038644918_53405051.jpg\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">接下来就是常规的天子分析和后续预测：</div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1630038759608_45090606.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1630038759608_45090606.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1630038763419_54752481.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1630038763419_54752481.png\"></div><br></div></span></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1630038763419_54752481.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1630038759608_45090606.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1630038644918_53405051.jpg"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 63428, "username": "土星Saturn", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_600/h_600/202/63428/2023/0/12/382898.png", "description": "勇气带给我力量 希望带给我爱", "follow_num": 1398, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "画饼王", "tag_color": "#F2AD18"}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 9, "content_at": 45063289, "content_num": 281, "read_num": 6803790, "like_num": 4765}, "update_user": {"uid": 0, "username": "", "avatar": "", "description": "", "follow_num": 0, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 0, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "read_num": 0, "like_num": 0}, "game": {"id": 202, "name": "天命之子", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1600339074877_54241879.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250", "alias": "dc", "content_count": 7758, "follow_count": 14519}, "themes": null, "seo_format": {"title": "", "desc": "", "key": ""}, "video_format": {"cover": "", "video": "", "width": "", "height": "", "duration": 0, "video_compressed": ""}, "contributor": null, "vote_list": null, "ban_image_list": null, "is_strategy": false, "is_strategy_v1": false, "entry_data_bind":